In the case of Ultrix, you don't even need the old system to run Ultrix =
binaries, because IIRC, they're all statically-linked.  There's already =
been one example of "ability to run commercial software for Ultrix" =
posted in this thread, and we should let that keep working (believe it =
or not, it actually works really well in the Ultrix case, as well as =
SunOS on SPARC, though you do need the system shared libraries and =
dynamic linker in that case).

-- thorpej



